From: ButlerX <butlerx@localhost>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 08:50:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] qca-nss-ecm: mark TCP tracker callbacks static

The TCP tracker callbacks are assigned only within their implementation
unit and are not exported.  Give them internal linkage for GCC14.

--- a/ecm_tracker_tcp.c
+++ b/ecm_tracker_tcp.c
@@ -574,1 +574,1 @@
-void ecm_tracker_tcp_ref_callback(struct ecm_tracker_instance *ti)
+static void ecm_tracker_tcp_ref_callback(struct ecm_tracker_instance *ti)
@@ -591,1 +591,1 @@
-int ecm_tracker_tcp_deref_callback(struct ecm_tracker_instance *ti)
+static int ecm_tracker_tcp_deref_callback(struct ecm_tracker_instance *ti)
-- 
2.43.0
